sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Central caller
  participant M as Host manager and adapter
  participant L as Lab AI4R API
  C->>M: Stable request ID and intended outcome
  M->>M: Persist ID, fingerprint and target lab
  M->>L: Lookup mapped native client_request_id
  alt Existing native allocation
    L-->>M: Same native run ID and status
  else Authenticated native no-allocation result
    M->>L: Native intake preparation
    L-->>M: Intake reference and submission defaults
    M->>M: Persist exact prepared submission
    M->>L: Submit with same durable native ID
  end
  Note over M,L: Delivery unknown after timeout.<br/>Reconnect and query the SAME native ID.
  M-->>C: Native run identity or explicit uncertain state
  C->>M: Inspect progress, result or request cancellation
  M->>L: Native status, events, result or cancel
  L-->>M: Native outcome
  M-->>C: Native outcome projected for caller
